2227821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TurHt","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-19T11:39:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T11:40:58Z","body":"Further context needs to be provided here that this is specifically rolling back the contents of this PR, which provides tangible performance benefits (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98701). Please don't skip on the context as it makes it more confusing for reviewers to evaluate.\r\n\r\nGiven we haven't seen it cause issues anywhere else but this family of GPUs on this particular driver, what should be addressed first and foremost is verifying if there's actual synchronization layer validation issues that are detected and fixed by reverting the PR. If that's not the case, then we must only add a workaround only under this specific hardware, as it'd kill the performance benefit of the PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3552227821/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776195754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112937#issuecomment-3776195754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112937","id":3776195754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hFCyq","user":{"login":"TacoGuyAT","id":35270005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjcwMDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35270005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT","html_url":"https://github.com/TacoGuyAT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T05:15:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T05:15:25Z","body":"I've got some spare time to figure out how to implement it as a workaround, so here's an updated variant. I'm not sure if the namings or descriptions are correct enough, but in general it works. I looked up device IDs for GCN-based cards on [this website](https://admin.pci-ids.ucw.cz/read/PC/1002) and checked for correct architectures on TechPowerUp and checked it once again on RX 590.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b67fe939-2b33-48c7-b57e-c312bde8d5c9\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bd456cc-f06a-4617-9814-0a1a9878de82\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776195754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3796815225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112937#issuecomment-3796815225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112937","id":3796815225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iTs15","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T15:08:22Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T15:08:22Z","body":"I tested the PR artifact with two meshes and seems to not fix the issue in my case.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15bf488c-f85a-4071-8f4b-cb94e3419794\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nGodot v4.6.rc (3a3ef5c6b) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3796815225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797541957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112937#issuecomment-3797541957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112937","id":3797541957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iWeRF","user":{"login":"TacoGuyAT","id":35270005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjcwMDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35270005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT","html_url":"https://github.com/TacoGuyAT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T01:17:33Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T01:17:33Z","body":"> I tested the PR artifact with two meshes and seems to not fix the issue in my case.\r\n> unknown_2026.01.25-12.03.mp4\r\n> \r\n> Godot v4.6.rc ([3a3ef5c](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/3a3ef5c6be12a91565b7768a7a438d4ddcc8a5a0)) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory\r\n\r\nSorry for the confusion, perhaps it's better to say this PR is aimed at fixing another issue, which is more similar to what happens in #101831. I assumed it was the part of a bug that the #61415 issue was initially describing, which I'm unable to reproduce neither on RX 580 nor RX 590 on my side anymore for some reason. At this point I'm unsure if all three are actually related to each other. Could you share your MRP, please? Also, I'm not sure if 2048SP card falls under the IDs I've added, it would be great if you could check your device ID.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797541957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3808596092","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112937#issuecomment-3808596092","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112937","id":3808596092,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jApB8","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T02:26:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T02:26:24Z","body":"It seems that my card is detected as make the `workarounds.force_write_usage = true`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1298\" height=\"422\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2d48c06-7457-43e7-aee9-3343693ad281\" />\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nHere's the MRP i used. The size of the meshes and the angle of the camera seems to affect how the bug happens as at some small sizes the bug doesn't reproduce and with a bigger mesh all of them just stays black instead show the black artifacts.\r\n\r\n[test-msaa-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24898539/test-msaa-bug.zip)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3808596092/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020354191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112937#issuecomment-4020354191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112937","id":4020354191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vobyP","user":{"login":"TacoGuyAT","id":35270005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjcwMDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35270005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT","html_url":"https://github.com/TacoGuyAT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TacoGuyAT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T00:20:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T00:23:27Z","body":"I got RX 580 GPU once again and my workaround doesn't work consistently enough after some testing. I'm still not sure what is the reason behind this bug, but both of the issues seem to be the same one in the end: amount and pattern of artifacts change based on shadows size, faces density, MSAA mode and, strangely for me, get fixed when my PR is used and SDFGI is enabled, which was the reason of why my test scene appears normal, while this MRP doesn't, unless you enable SDFGI. When shadows are disabled - I wasn't able to trigger it at all.\r\n\r\nSince the release of D3D12 driver, I've been relying on it to make editor and game render properly, so I can only suggest doing the same as a \"fix\" or waiting for a smarter guy to work on this issue, sorry.\r\n\r\n> It seems that my card is detected as make the `workarounds.force_write_usage = true`\r\n> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"1298\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44306054/541370245-e2d48c06-7457-43e7-aee9-3343693ad281.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..cUiOZeP6zxtlOS2vrkaeHc2xZmJPT2EHESo3jQa_hGo\">\r\n> \r\n> Here's the MRP i used. The size of the meshes and the angle of the camera seems to affect how the bug happens as at some small sizes the bug doesn't reproduce and with a bigger mesh all of them just stays black instead show the black artifacts.\r\n> \r\n> [test-msaa-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24898539/test-msaa-bug.zip)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020354191/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]